# Docker Desktop Synchronized File Share ignore list (.dockerignore syntax).
# This repo is served into the claude-secure-container sandbox via a
# synchronized share; see that repo's docker-compose.yml. Paths here are
# never copied into the VM-side ext4 copy and never synced back.
#
# Bytecode only — in-container it is already redirected to a volume
# (PYTHONPYCACHEPREFIX); on the host it is macOS bytecode.
**/__pycache__
#
# Keep .git SYNCED (do not add it here): excluded paths never reach the VM
# copy, so ignoring it would leave the container's checkout with no repo.
#
# Note: this repo is the source of the sandbox's skills/agents snapshot. That
# snapshot is a host-side copy made by `./run --rebuild` from the HOST tree,
# so the share does not change how skills reach the container or the review
# model (edits are reviewed via git, picked up only at rebuild).
